## Command

```shell
biome inspect plugins '--path=<TEMP_DIR>/absolute_target_matches_anchored_override_and_plugin_includes/src/file.ts'
```

## `biome.json`

```json
{
  "extends": ["./shared/base.json"],
  "plugins": [
    "./base.grit",
    { "path": "./src-only.grit", "includes": ["src/**", "!src/generated/**"] }
  ],
  "overrides": [
    {
      "includes": ["src/**", "!src/vendor/**"],
      "plugins": [
        {
          "path": "./src-override.grit",
          "includes": ["src/**", "!src/generated/**"]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
```

## `base.grit`

```grit
`unterminated
```

